        "accessed_on": "2026-10-27",
        "note": "Every datum is artificial. Independent per-axis plastic recurrence: trial=Q*(e-z); dz=sign(trial)*max(abs(trial)-Y-H*a,0)/(Q+H); z+=dz; a+=abs(dz); S=Q*(e-z). Q=[1000,500,250], Y=[10,8,5], H=[100,50,25]. Observed TOTAL stresses add the independently prescribed Maxwell branches at every recorded time, including unobserved loads/dwells. Fixed coefficients below are not estimated by the six-parameter fit. No empirical textile or garment claim."
      },
      "fixed-spectrum": {
        "reference": "test:independent-fixed-parallel-maxwell-spectrum",
        "accessed_on": "2026-10-27",
        "note": "Artificial independent relaxation spectrum. Fast branch Q=diag(500,250,125) N/m, tau=0.5 s. Slow branch Q=[[200,20,0],[20,100,0],[0,0,40]] N/m, tau=2 s. Independently computed endpoint recurrence z_next=tau/(tau+dt)*z_old+dt/(tau+dt)*e; branch stress=Q*(e-z_next). Not a measured relaxation acquisition or fitted by this request."
      },
      "network": {
        "reference": "test:declared-parallel-plastic-maxwell-network",
