        "note": "Artificial explicit additive network qualification for a matched specimen and constant conditioning: equilibrium plastic flow sees only equilibrium stress; the fixed Maxwell branches see total imposed Green strain and retain separate viscous history. This declares a software example, not evidence for a real textile."
      }
